% This package simplifies writing Bangla or Assamese documents in LaTeX.
% It provides automatic font switching between the selected language and Latin
% text, localized labels and numbering, and integration with supported packages.
% Authors can use ordinary LaTeX commands with either language alongside English.
% See the manual for configuration, examples, and supported features.
